nv          number of visible units=lattice sites (1331 for atoms)
nh          number of hidden units
sigma       0.001 std deviation for gaussian initializer for rbm weights
loadtype    0,1,2,3 0:random weights 1: visible from file, random hidden, 2: all weights loaded from file, 3: all weights loaded from file+ random hidden 
restartfn   file containing weights
model       Coulomb3d/ArgonneV6 atoms/nuclei
M            number of particles
spin_up     spin up particles
spin_down   spin down
seed        -1 (random)
printstates 1 print sampled configurations on file if true
filestates  test.dat test (useless)
nsweeps     5000 number of MC sweeps per itereations in the metropolis algorithm
niter       1000 nuber of epochs
get_pars    save rbm's weight on file every get_pars iterations
Nprotons    Z (protons in the nucleus for atoms)
traplength  4.0 physical length of the trap , a_0 for atoms, fm for nuclei
isospin     0 atoms 1 nuclei
iso_up      1 number of isospin up particles (protons)
iso_down    1 number of isospin down particles (neutrons)
eta         0.04 starting learning rate
eta1        50 learning rate decay
label 	    name of weights file will be weights+label.dat
trainingfn  name of the output training file containing energy and error for every epoch
